  "title": "Fabienne&#39;s Hasselback Potatoes",
  "description": "This recipe for roasted accordion potatoes produces creamy-on-the-inside and perfectly crispy-on-the-outside results every time.",
  "authors": [
    "Fabienne Riesen"
  ],
